# Kaldvik Fjord: a lap that is nearly all climb, given back in one jump.
# Units in metres: x east, z south, from the world's north-west corner.
#
# From the fjord-head flat the road runs east through the hamlet's market
# street, on ice, and turns up the fjord wall: seven switchbacks, each leg
# shorter than it looks, the fourth hairpin turned inside the rock. Over the
# fell at the top it drops into a ski-jump inrun at the edge of the wall,
# and a kart flies off the table and comes down a landing hill shaped to its
# flight, out onto the flat and the line.
track kaldvik_fjord size 768 style fjord
title KALDVIK FJORD
blurb A blue winter dusk at the head of a fjord: seven switchbacks up the fjord wall under the aurora, a run over the fell, and a ski jump that gives the whole climb back in one long flight down to the line.
race laps 2 rivals 5 vehicle kart
road 14.5 bank 1.3
land 30 1.5
hour 16
lights 25
materials verge packed_snow

